# GFA's grouped L1 normalization is represented as softmax * reciprocal(sum).
# The operands have wide, correlated ranges, but the normalized product is
# mathematically bounded to [0, 1]. Prevent independent worst-case propagation
# from inflating the ew_mult output range and exhausting the 8-bit shift.
quantization_param(
    [receiver_stage45/ew_mult1, receiver_stage45/ew_mult2],
    force_range_out=[0.0, 1.0]
)
